            "review_title": "Review at Snuffbox",
            "review_text": "Antonio Barrilli\n4 contributions\n0\nA wonderful experience, highly recommended for anyone with style.\nFeb 2026 • Friends\nSnuffbox is a hidden gem. The atmosphere is intimate and relaxed, the design feels thoughtful and timeless, and the cocktails are truly top quality. Great music, great crowd, and a place where you can actually enjoy the night without noise or chaos. Definitely worth coming back.\nWritten February 12, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
