            "review_title": "Review at Snuffbox",
            "review_text": "Geh R\nIsrael4 contributions\n1\nUnique cocktails, chill atmosphere\nDec 2017 • Friends\nTucked away on the 2nd floor of a seemingly non-descript building, Snuffbox is one cool bar to check out if you're up for ultimate chill vibes and fancy cocktail concoctions. \n\nTheir signature creation cocktails appear to be their selling point, each themed differently with an fine amount of detail in their cocktail presentation (if that's your sort of thing). That being said, these go for about 180,000 dong a pop (or 150,000 for regular cocktails) so there are definitely more affordable options for other budgets. \n\nHowever, if you're looking for a quiet bar to unwind on a weekday night with the ultimate chill vibes / chill music, would recommend Snuffbox 10/10 \n\n*Like most places in Vietnam, smoking IS permitted inside so that may or may not work in your favour! \n\n**Went with friends on 2 consecutive weekday nights from 10pm-1am\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 4, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
