            "review_text": "Shaun M\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam299 contributions\n0\nCool Speakeasy!\nAug 2016 • Friends\nA place well worth finding! Hidden in a local apartment complex in the center of District one is this really cool find! A speakeasy lays behind a door that looks like the entrance to an old lift. Inside you will be surprised a little ooh and ahh can be heard from your friends as you cannot believe this cool place exists. A fully stocked bar with barmen and women that really know how to prepare a greta cocktail. A great feel as you gaze outside the window into city life below or take in the sights and sounds of this really cool decorated lounge. One of the true delights of ho chi minh city.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 15, 2016",
