            "review_title": "Review at Snuffbox",
            "review_text": "Jel86\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1029 contributions\n0\nExcellent cocktail, like in a old cocktail house in NYC!\nMay 2016 • Business\nExcellent cocktail. An old cocktail house in NYC? Yes, this is what I felt when I got there the first time, before I returned many times. Decro is top notch, drinks are formidable, specially the bourbon sours. Nice craft beer too. No food, I think. But really the cigarette smoke is a big negative: unless you sit in the heat on the balcony, you will choke if you are a non-smoker. Investing on a venttalion system would be great!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 22, 2016",
