            "review_text": "minht749\n24 contributions\n0\nReally interesting vibe\nJun 2016\nA real New York vibe in the heart of Ho Chi Minh City. Great interior style and calm yet chilled enough music atmosphere. The cocktails are really tasty and interesting in terms of concept. \n\nOne thing I don't like is my body and clothes smelled like cigarette after leaving. Please don't let guests smoke inside because there is a really nice open-air patio can smokers can hang out and have a a cigarette! Looking at the empty street and feel the Saigonese ambiance from the patio is a nice experience too!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 2, 2016",
